{
 "_about": "سبب النزول (add-on 0033-add7 §أ): HadeethEnc category 14 «أسباب النزول» (ar v1.7.0) linked to ayat by fixed rules, no AI; built by scripts/daily/asbab-build.mjs from data/raw/hadeethenc/ar and data/processed/quran.jsonl. Ids and ayah keys only: the texts are read from the source data at display time. Display conditions for later: only tiers 1–3 (never `mixed`, never tier X); a mawquf hadith (`mawquf: true`) is never introduced with «قال رسول الله ﷺ». Entries with `reviewed: false` are not shown until the coordinator approves them. The coordinator's decisions (data/asbab-decisions.json, reply 0037 §2) are applied after the rules: `reviewed: true` with ayat is shown, with none (`decision: not_linked`) it is not, and `added` lists the ayat a decision added to an automatic link. `by_ayah` holds what the app may show; `outside_category` is a review list only and is not in `by_ayah`.",
 "rule": "In order, the first that gives an ayah: (1) bracket: «[sura: n]» in the hadith text (the explanation only when the text has none), the sura name normalised and equal to a sura_name of quran.jsonl, ranges and lists expanded; (2) full_text: the whole text of an ayah of 3+ words inside the hadith text after normalisation (no harakat or Quranic marks; أ/إ/آ/ٱ→ا, ة→ه, ى→ي), an ayah inside a longer matched ayah dropped, a text found in two or more ayat not linked; (3) longest_run: the longest run of shared consecutive words, accepted at 6+ words and 3+ ahead of the runner-up ayah; (4) review: out/asbab-review.md, `reviewed: false`.",
